      "start_line": 24,
      "text": "  rule loopBody() =>\n    If(Call(Attribute(Name(\"string\"), \"startswith\"), Name(\"prefix\")),\n       Expr(Call(Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"), Name(\"string\"))) .Stmts,\n       .Stmts) .Stmts"
