      "start_line": 29,
      "text": "  rule solutionProgram() =>\n    Module(\n      ImportFrom(\"typing\", \"List\", .Strings)\n      FuncDef(\"filter_by_prefix\", Params(\"strings\", \"prefix\", .Strings),\n        Assign(Name(\"result\"), ListExpr())\n        For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"), loopBody())\n        Return(Name(\"result\"))))"
